== Trivia ==
* {{dlc|nr}} When the [[Shop (Item Pool)|Shop item pool]] is depleted, it is possible to find The Quarter for sale in the store for 15 cents. This can also occur in the {{R|I AM ERROR}} room.
* In the original ''The Binding of Isaac'', A Quarter was unlocked by beating {{E|Mom's Heart}} four times instead of eight.
** It was also present in the [[Devil Room (Item Pool)|Devil Room]] item pool in the original game and in the “Antibirth” mod.
*** {{dlc|r}} It is now part of the [[Devil Room (Item Pool)|Devil Room]] item pool again.

